SUMMARY:First Day of School – Kinder and 6th Grade Only (Half Day)
DESCRIPTION:The first day for Kindergarten and 6th grade is on Tuesday\, September 3rd. This day will be a half day\, with drop off beginning at 7:40 am and pick up beginning at 11:30 am. On this day\, kinder and 6th grade students will be able to get comfortable in their classrooms\, meet their teachers\, learn about car line and get familiar with the campus before all students start the next day. Students will not have lunch on this day but should bring a snack\, and uniform dress should be worn. \nMorning Drop Off\nOn the kindergartener’s first day\, kindergarten families should park on campus (parking will be available in the lower parking lot & overflow parking is available in the upper recess parking lot). Please arrive outside of the school office between 7:40 and 8:00 am to escort your student inside the building. \nOn 6th grade’s first day\, 6th grade families should drop off following normal car line procedures between 7:40 and 8:00 am. \nAfternoon Pick Up\nParents should plan on picking up their student through normal afternoon car line\, beginning at 11:30 am on September 3rd.
URL:https://sherwoodcharterschool.org/event/first-day-of-school-kinder-and-6th-grade-only-half-day-3/
